===New Zealand National Party (60)===
The [[New Zealand National Party|National Party]] won 47.04% of the vote, entitling it to 60 seats. As it won 41 electorates, an additional 19 members were taken from the party list. After the resignation of [[Northland (New Zealand electorate)|Northland MP]] [[Mike Sabin]] a [[2015 Northland by-election|by-election]] was held and lost to [[New Zealand First]]. The party's share of seats was reduced to 59.
 
15 new National Party members were elected, nine from electorates and six from the list. 45 members from the 50th Parliament were returned.
